{"availability":"available","full":"TMHSDigital/editorial-agency-frontend-demo","name":"editorial-agency-frontend-demo","description":"Premium single-file editorial / brutalist-minimalism agency landing page demo (fictional brand: TMHS Digital). Hand-built HTML/CSS/vanilla JS, no framework, no build step. Companion to syncflow-frontend-demo.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-16T01:19:53Z","updated":"2026-06-16T02:19:56Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tmhsdigital.github.io/editorial-agency-frontend-demo/","topics":["brutalism","demo","editorial-design","frontend","github-pages","html-css-javascript","landing-page","responsive-design","vanilla-js","web-design"],"demo":"https://tmhsdigital.github.io/editorial-agency-frontend-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T21:03:27.494Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T21:03:27.494Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T21:03:27.494Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.308Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:03:27.494Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A \"Chromatype Brutalism\" agency landing page contained in a single index.html file.","No framework, no build step. The markup, styles, and scripts are self-contained, and the page renders directly in any modern browser.","TMHS Digital is a fictional studio created for this demo. The services, metrics, testimonials, and partner names are placeholders and do not represent real claims."],"features":["Asymmetric grid. A narrow structural rail offsets a massive primary canvas, and each section pairs a slim utility-notes column with a wide body. Generous, unexpected padding gives major statements absolute breathing…","Razor-thin structure. Sections are separated by crisp 1px borders (border-bottom / border-right) rather than background blocks or heavy shadows.","High-contrast type. Two families only: Syne for aggressively large display headers with tight line-heights, juxtaposed against hyper-precise JetBrains Mono for labels, nav, and utility text.","Raw industrial color. A strict 60/30/10 split: raw-cement canvas (#d9d5cc), intense off-black ink (#14130f) for text and structure, and a single international-orange accent (#f23c00) reserved exclusively for active link…","Tactile motion. Hover states use a weighted, mechanical transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1) — like shifting a solid physical toggle, never bouncy."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TMHSDigital/editorial-agency-frontend-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fd3d7edef9bbeb6ae3b8b35b4697f4a44b09ec6afa8e3c45a54141e37cbc4585","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.472Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.472Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A \"Chromatype Brutalism\" agency landing page contained in a single index.html file.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TMHSDigital/editorial-agency-frontend-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"fd3d7edef9bbeb6ae3b8b35b4697f4a44b09ec6afa8e3c45a54141e37cbc4585","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TMHSDigital/editorial-agency-frontend-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.472Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-16T02:19:56Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TMHSDigital/editorial-agency-frontend-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.473Z","hash":"fd3d7edef9bbeb6ae3b8b35b4697f4a44b09ec6afa8e3c45a54141e37cbc4585","originalBytes":8344,"storedBytes":8344,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["license","github","page","single","image","screenshots","site","accent","build","css","grid","hero","objection","proof","raw","scripts","amp","bce99.png","canvas","capabilities","column","deploy.yml","deployment","html","index.html","ink","javascript","landing","matrix","mit","open","pages","states","studio","text","top","under","workflows","agency","aggressi